        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Meghan Markle, Gabriel Macht, Patrick J. Adams, Rick Hoffman, Sarah Rafferty, Gina Torres, Stacey Dash, Reagan Gomez-Preston, Wesley Jonathan, Datari Turner, Tatyana Ali, Meagan Good, Jason Weaver, Persia White, Terrell Owens, Stacy Keibler, Hosea Chanchez, Christian Keyes\n- TV Series: Suits, Fringe\n- Films: Dysfunctional Friends\n- Organizations: Pearson Darby, Pearson Darby Specter, Pearson Specter\n- Places: Manhattan, Los Angeles\n- Roles: Rachel Zane, Amy Jessup\n\nFacts:\n- On October 12, 2012, the third season of the American legal comedy-drama Suits was ordered.\n- In 2012, the American drama comedy film Dysfunctional Friends featured Meghan Markle among its starring cast.\n- Since 2011, Meghan Markle has portrayed Rachel Zane on the legal drama series Suits.\n- Meghan Markle is also known for playing FBI special agent Amy Jessup in the sci-fi thriller Fringe.\n- Meghan Markle was born on August 4, 1981, and is an American actress, model, and humanitarian from Los Angeles.\n- Suits season 3 had six series regulars playing employees at the fictional Manhattan law firm Pearson Darby, later Pearson Darby Specter and Pearson Specter: Gabriel Macht, Patrick J. Adams, Rick Hoffman, Meghan Markle, Sarah Rafferty, and Gina Torres.",
